<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Admin sign in · Quizzo</title><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"><link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin><link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Playfair+Display:wght@500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet"><link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/lucide-static@latest/font/lucide.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/admin.css"></head><body class="admin-body login-body"><main class="login-layout"><section class="login-art"><div class="hero-geometry" aria-hidden="true"><span class="geometry-axis"></span><span class="geometry-frame"></span><span class="geometry-diamond"></span><span class="geometry-dots"></span><span class="geometry-tick"></span></div><div class="art-content"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-rule"></span>QUIZZO ADMINISTRATION</div><h1>Make room<br>for <em>curiosity.</em></h1><p>A considered space to tend to the quizzes, people, and shared challenges that make Quizzo.</p><div class="art-ornament" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><span></span><span></span><i></i></div></div></section><section class="login-side"><div class="login-card"><div class="eyebrow"><span class="eyebrow-rule"></span>WELCOME BACK</div><h2>Sign in to your<br>workspace</h2><p class="login-desc">Your thoughtful work, all in one place.</p><form class="admin-login-form" data-login-form><label class="field"><span>Email address</span><div class="input-wrap"><span class="input-icon"><i data-lucide="mail"></i></span><input type="email" required autocomplete="username" placeholder="admin@quizzo.com"></div></label><label class="field"><span>Password</span><div class="input-wrap"><span class="input-icon"><i data-lucide="lock-keyhole"></i></span><input id="admin-password" type="password" required autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="Enter your password"><button class="password-toggle" type="button" aria-label="Show password" aria-pressed="false" data-password-toggle><i data-lucide="eye" data-eye aria-hidden="true"></i><%- include('../../partials/password-eye-off') %></button></div></label><div class="login-options"><label class="remember-option"><input type="checkbox" name="rememberMe"><span class="remember-box" aria-hidden="true"></span><span>Remember me</span></label><a class="forgot-link" href="/admin/forgot-password">Forgot password?</a></div><button class="button button-primary login-submit" type="submit">Access Portal</button><p class="login-message" role="status" data-login-message></p></form></div><a class="app-switch" href="http://localhost:3200/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="app-switch-copy"><strong>Quizzo application</strong><span class="app-switch-description">Explore quizzes and challenges.</span></span><span class="app-switch-icon"><i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></span></a></section></main><script src="https://unpkg.com/lucide@latest"></script><script src="/js/admin.js"></script></body></html>
